 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "«Hei... unasema Kiswahili? Hapana? ...lahaula.»"
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"This one — Muscadine Grapes. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They answer at length. They nod, holding your gaze a beat longer."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They answer at length. A smile, tired but real."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They answer at length. You press a hand to your own chest, then point at them. Together — they get it."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You listen hard, watching their mouth shape the words. Sounds, and the shape of meaning just out of reach."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Wanjiru laughs — with you, mostly. \"Good try! Again — Ndiyo, uko sahihi..\" They walk you through it, patient as sunrise."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. They're really talking to you now."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"That again?\" Fernando sighs. \"I confessed that already. I'm not confessing it twice for dramatic effect.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Whatever warmth was building cools to politeness."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"About what happened to my taken kin — You talk to it -- the System. Have you ever asked? About the taken -- about Barbara? No rush.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"It's my sister, Barbara. Was taken at the Scattering. The boring half, they said — my sister, boring. I think about that every day. Some nights I dream about the pods -- rows of them, humming. I wake up and I can't tell if it was a dream or a broadcast.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Diana owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Out there? With YOU leading? ...Let me think about it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I sharpen sticks down to nothing at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "You show them Common Plantain — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Alright — carefully, now. Both of us.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"What's the kindest thing someone's done for you out here?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"That's the good stuff. Quiet generosity. It's holding this whole thing together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Can I be honest? Someone saved me the last of the stew once. Didn't say anything, just put the bowl down and walked off. I think about that bowl more than I think about the monsters.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"The System wants us together. Every reward pushes cooperation. It's lonely up there, maybe. Or it's running an experiment on trust.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Heh. Still on the big questions.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "You show them Common Plantain — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Zuri grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "🤝 Zuri is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"You look handy. What did you do with your hands, before? You know?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Useful. Everything useful matters now. I mean that as a compliment.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"These hands? Firefighter hands. Clipboards, mostly. Now they hold wire and wood, and they learn fast. Hands are honest that way.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Still on what you did with your hands.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? Anyway, that's me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Since Diana died... I keep expecting to see Diana at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"I don't pray, exactly. But I talk to the sky sometimes. It hasn't answered yet.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"We were just talking. Nothing important.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "You show them Wild Strawberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"They took you — The Secret Deck, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Same weather, different day. I keep notes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "🤝 Zuri is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"About what happened to my taken kin — I keep dreaming about rows of pods. Humming. Tell me I'm not the only one. You'd know about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They settle in like someone glad you're here."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Still nothing on Barbara. I told you about the pods -- I keep thinking about them. The humming. Some nights I'm sure it's a dream. Other nights I'm sure it's not.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"The Secret Deck. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Zuri nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"My part? I sharpen sticks down to nothing and stay ready.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening. That's still where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "You show them Wild Strawberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Zuri: \"Hey — come here. You should hear this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "On the way, Zuri stops and actually teaches you something — how they read a slope for water, how their grandmother did it. (Knowledge, freely given. The Codex notes it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Any regrets? The real kind, not the small stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Quiet. \"Yeah. I think everyone's carrying one of those.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Still on your regrets.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"Have you heard what they're calling The Focus Group? Fernando is pushing 'The Loud Thing'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Fernando nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"I'm sorry — I'm achy and wrung out, barely keeping food down. Will you help me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"The fever's not breaking and I'm barely keeping food down. I need help — real help, not just water.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Their eyes do the math before their mouth does. You can see the calculation happening."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Quiet for a long time. Then, barely audible: \"I took 2× Stick. I won't do it again.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Do you believe in anything? Now, I mean. After everything.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"That's not naive. That's load-bearing. Hold onto it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Right. I get it.\" A beat — and then the subject is closed. They won't raise it again."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Still on that sickness help.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"No — you're right, it's a lot. Forget it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"You talk to it -- the System. Have you ever asked? About the taken -- about Barbara?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"I see.\" They take a moment to think about your answer."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Still nothing on Barbara. I told you about the pods -- I keep thinking about them. The humming. Some nights I'm sure it's a dream. Other nights I'm sure it's not.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"They took you — Hardened The Secret Deck, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"As I said — Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "Zuri nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? At night I count the stars and name them after people.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "Domingo has an edge today — something curdled."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided. Right. Right.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "Something crosses their face — quick, then gone. The practiced expression clicks back into place."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"I'm not from Denver. I'm from Brooklyn, New York. I wasn't protecting myself. I was protecting someone else.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"...Anyway. What did you want to ask?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "A flicker at the corner of their mouth. Not quite a smile. Not quite anything."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"I wasn't a Firefighter. I was a trail crew lead. If the wrong people know, it doesn't fall on me. It falls on them.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "Fernando nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"What do you miss most? From before.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"God. Yes. I dream about soup. Actual soup, with a spoon. I mean it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "I tell my story so I don't lose it. Memory needs an audience or it fades."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I'm a museum of a dead world. Admission's free. Please visit.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I'm scared of forgetting the small things. The way they laughed. That's what goes first.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Still on wanting to preserve who they were.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Anyway — that's my cross to carry. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Someone helped me recently. I'm still turning it over — people don't do that for nothing, out here. Or maybe they do now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Did you leave someone behind? ...Sorry. You don't have to answer that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Just: \"Yeah.\" A long quiet. \"Me too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Domingo nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Please — I can't shake it. I'm achy and wrung out, barely keeping food down. I need help. Please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Rest and clean water aren't cutting it. If this turns, I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. I need someone who knows what they're doing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Someone helped me recently. I'm still turning it over — people don't do that for nothing, out here. Or maybe they do now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I'll pay it forward. That's the only math that works.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"That's enough for now. It'll percolate.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"About the pantry run — I hate to ask twice, but it's still open. Will you?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"Another day like today and we're choosing who eats. Meet me at the north treeline by the fallen oak and we'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"They took you — The Vigil, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "🤝 Fernando is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"Like I said — Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about what's been happening — that was 12 days back. Still on your mind? 'You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine.' We still owe that sickness help a proper ending, too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"The plan is the plan until it isn't. Then we make a new one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"My part? I clean up other people's messes quietly and stay ready.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 106,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  }
 ],
