  "deathBeat": [
   "d41: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Jessica Dong is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d41: 🕯️ Jessica Dong is dead — the expedition. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
   "d41: The village's quarrel was with Jessica — and Jessica is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.",
   "d41: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Glow Stag is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d42: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Nina Petrova is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d42: 🕯️ Word comes back with a torn pack and no Nina. The Terms of Service, out past the ridge. The fire is quieter tonight.",
   "d43: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Ugly Beast is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
  ],
  "recoverHome": [
   "d42: That night, they bring Jessica home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."
  ],
